{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"docfx-mref-page","file":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web.OperationNameToSummaryTransformer.yml","symbols":[{"uid":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web.OperationNameToSummaryTransformer","name":"OperationNameToSummaryTransformer","fullName":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web.OperationNameToSummaryTransformer","kind":"Class","namespace":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web","assembly":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web","summary":"Sets the operation summary directly from the operation name/ID.","remarks":"This transformer provides a simple summary generation strategy that uses the operation ID directly as the operation summary. This is useful for APIs that already have descriptive operation ID naming conventions and don\u0027t need additional text generation. Key responsibilities: Extracts the operation IDUses it directly as the summary without modificationRespects existing summaries from XML documentationProvides a clean, minimal approach to summary generation Example: Operation ID: \u0022CoreModule.TodoItems.GetAll\u0022 \u2192 Summary: \u0022CoreModule.TodoItems.GetAll\u0022Operation ID: \u0022TodoItems.GetById\u0022 \u2192 Summary: \u0022TodoItems.GetById\u0022","syntax":{"content":"public class OperationNameToSummaryTransformer : IOpenApiOperationTransformer","parameters":[],"returns":null},"parameters":[],"returns":null,"parent":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web","children":["BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web.OperationNameToSummaryTransformer.#ctor","BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web.OperationNameToSummaryTransformer.TransformAsync(Microsoft.OpenApi.OpenApiOperation,Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi.OpenApiOperationTransformerContext,System.Threading.CancellationToken)"],"extensionMethods":[],"examples":[],"url":"https://bridgingit-gmbh.github.io/bITdevKit/api/obj/api/BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web.OperationNameToSummaryTransformer.html","topics":["presentation"]},{"uid":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Presentation.Web.OperationNameToSummar